---
title: "Figure 2 — Same Agent, Same Interface: Different Data Access (AgentCore Gateway enforces Cedar policies at the parameter level)"
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant U as User
    participant A as Agent<br/>(Strands SDK)
    participant GW as AgentCore<br/>Gateway
    participant CE as Cedar Policy<br/>Engine
    participant T as MCP Tool<br/>(Lambda)

    %% === Sarah Chen — Plant Manager (Full Access) ===
    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over U, T: Sarah Chen (Plant Manager) — Full Access: all plants, all lines

        U->>A: "Which assembly lines need attention this week?"
        A->>GW: get_equipment_status(scope=all) + Bearer JWT
        GW->>CE: Evaluate: role=plant_manager, scope=all
        Note right of CE: has_full_access = true<br/>→ Bypasses all forbid rules<br/>Result: ALLOW ✓
        CE-->>GW: ALLOW
        GW->>T: Execute Lambda
        activate T
        T-->>GW: Data for all 12 lines
        deactivate T
        GW-->>A: Full results
        A-->>U: "Lines 4, 9, and 11 need attention.<br/>Line 4: bearing temp 12°C above baseline..."
    end

    %% === Raj Patel — Line Supervisor (Scoped to Line 7) ===
    rect rgb(255, 235, 238)
        Note over U, T: Raj Patel (Line Supervisor) — Scope: Line 7, Plant 2

        U->>A: "Show me Line 4 equipment status"
        A->>GW: get_equipment_status(line="Line 4") + Bearer JWT
        GW->>CE: Evaluate: role=line_supervisor, line_scope=Line 7, requested=Line 4
        Note right of CE: forbid_line_scope:<br/>"Line 4" in ["Line 7"]? NO<br/>→ FORBID triggered<br/>Result: DENY ✗
        CE-->>GW: DENY
        Note over T: Lambda NOT invoked
        GW-->>A: "[Policy] Access denied — Line 4 outside scope"
        A-->>U: "I can't access Line 4. Your scope covers Line 7.<br/>Would you like Line 7 equipment status instead?"
    end

    %% === Priya Nair — Maintenance Technician (Scoped to Machines 41-45) ===
    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over U, T: Priya Nair (Maintenance Tech) — Scope: Machines 41–45

        U->>A: "What's the vibration on Machine 72?"
        A->>GW: get_sensor_readings(machine_id=72, metric=vibration) + Bearer JWT
        GW->>CE: Evaluate: role=maintenance_tech, equipment_scope=[41-45], requested=72
        Note right of CE: forbid_equipment_scope:<br/>72 in [41,42,43,44,45]? NO<br/>→ FORBID triggered<br/>Result: DENY ✗
        CE-->>GW: DENY
        Note over T: Lambda NOT invoked
        GW-->>A: "[Policy] Access denied — Machine 72 not in assignment"
        A-->>U: "Machine 72 isn't in your assignment list.<br/>I can check Machine 42 vibration — want me to?"
    end
